1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From 1894  became the  owner of  the Zagare Estate in Lithuania.Great landlord, lots of great works done by Georgij Naryshkin in Lithuania.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dmitrij Ivanovicz Naryszkin- owner of Zagare and Gruzdziai estates in Lithuania  from 1858 y. His sons were Georgij and Aleksander, wife-  Elizabeth , nee Knight. Georgij Dmitrijewicz Naryszkin died on 1924 in Kensnigton(London), 
2 CONC his  son Boris died on 1922. Both  were burried in  Brookwood cemetery(Surrey), plot 42. Here is burried also Elizabeth Naryshin, nee Knight (died on 1931). Daughter of Boris  Naryshkin and Ethel, nee  Elvy- Nadezda married John L
2 CONC .Elvy. Children born in South Africa(Johanesburg)-Anthony Lesley Elvy (b.1948), Penelope Ann Elvy (married Ian Rymer), Sheryl  Lee Elv y(born 1955). married to Ian Spurrier. Now in UK.
