1 NOTE {geni:about_me}   Natalia was the only child of Prince Alexander Mestchersky's first marriage to Countess Elizaveta Stroganov, and while on a tour of Italy, met and married Don Fabrizio,Duke of Sasso Ruffo. She later returned to R
2 CONC ussia following their separation with her three daughters, one of who married Baron Peter von Wrangel & another to Grand Duke Andrei Alexandrovich Romanov.
2 CONT   She achieved notoriety when she (unsuccessfully) petitioned the courts & Czar Nicholas II to dissolve her father's second marriage to opera singer Catherine Podborska,(forty years younger than him) on the grounds that she was ta
2 CONC king advantage of his age & senility. This along with her life story was detailed in a auto-biography by her step-sister (issue from the aforementioned later union) Catherine Mestchersky entilled: '' A Russian Princess Remembers "
2 CONC  ''
