2 CONT Prince Paolo Petrovich Troubetzkoy (also known as Pavel or Paul; Russian: Павел Петрович Трубецкой, romanized: Pavel Petrovich Trubetskoy; Intra, Italy, 15 February 1866 — Pallanza, 12 February 1938) was an Italian sculptor of Rus
2 CONC sian origin who was described by George Bernard Shaw as "the most astonishing sculptor of modern times".
