1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Princess Maria Pavlovna Golitsyna''' freilina in the court of Empress Maria Alexandrovna, consort to Czar Alexander II of Russia ,was married twice, prior to which she had an affair with Graf Pyotr Zuev with who
2 CONC m she had an illegitimate son. Her first husband was Minister-of-state, Alexei Zakharovich Khitrov which was only lasted one year, and upon divorcing him wed Pavel Vladimirovich Rodzianko with whom she had five children.
