1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Godfather of Elisaveta Vladimirovna Bezobrazov (1902+1996)
2 CONT
2 CONT Stenbock~Fermor, Count Aleksandr Vladimirovich (30.VIII.1878+18.XI.1945).  Educated in the Corps of Pages, promoted to His Majesty's Hussar Guards Regiment (1900), took part in the Russo~Japanese War (1904~1905), transferred to th
2 CONC e "Primorski" Dragoon Regiment (1904), transferred to the Reserve (1905).  Settled in France before the World War, perhaps because of his marriage (1929), and served in the French Army during the War.  Died in Paris. ~~ Les taxis 
2 CONC de la Marne, c'est lui  !! ~~
