2 CONT
2 CONT http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sayn-Wittgenstein
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT "The very week of the coronation, while Prince Yusupov, one of the Mikhailoviches, was at table with his father, the sound of a horse was heard from the next room. Suddenly, the door was flung o Pietari, Venäjä, Venäjäpen and ther
2 CONC e appeared a horseman with a fine presence, Prince G. Wittgenstein, one of the officers of the Tsar´s escort, an attractive man on whom all the court ladies doted. He held a bouquet of roses which he cast at the feet of the Prince
2 CONC ss. Then he jumped out of the open window and disappeared."
2 CONT
2 CONT                                                                                  Marc Ferro: Nicholas II, The Last of the Tsars
