1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rodzianko, Sergei Pavlovich (21.XI.1894+18.VI.1979).  The fourth of the famous five Rodzianko brothers.  Educated in the Tiflis Gymnasium,  entered the 1st (wartime) "Accelerated Course"of the Corps of Pages but we
2 CONC nt to the front before promotion,  accepted as a "Volunteer" in the Chevalier Gardes Regiment (XII.1914),  appointed General Bezobrazov's communications orderly (messenger),  awarded the soldier's Cross of St. George, 4th Class,  
2 CONC promoted to officer in the Chevalier Gardes by General Bezobrazov (1915),  attached to the Egerski Guards Regiment (IX.1916) during the temporary shortage of infantry officers and returned to the Chevalier Gardes (I.1917).  Left R
2 CONC ussia after the revolution and settled in England.
